@lesson T1.02 "Film & TV Phrases"

@word den Actionfilm = the action film
@word de romantesche Film = the romance film
@word d'Comedie = the comedy
@word den Drama = the drama
@word den Thriller = the thriller
@word den Horrorfilm = the horror movie
@word d'Science-Fiction = the science fiction
@word den Abenteuerfilm = the adventure film
@word d'Fantasie = the imagination
@word de Klassiker = the classic
@word de Musical = the musical
@word de Krimi = the crime film
@word den Animatiounsfilm = the animated film
@word de Familljefilm = the family movie
@word de Kuerzfilm = the short film
@word langweileg = boring
@word spannend = exciting
@word interessant = interesting
@word emotional = emotional
@word trist = dreary
@word fad = dull
@word lächerlech = ridiculous
@word komesch = strange
@word witzeg = funny
@word grujeleg = scary
@word spaasseg = amusing
@word traureg = sad
@word ergräifend = touching
@word erstaunlech = amazing
@word intensiv = intense
@word mënschlech = human

@sentence
@lu Den Actionfilm iwwer d'Superhelde war spannend.
@en The action movie about the superheroes was exciting.
@distractor-lu langweileg
@distractor-lu Kino
@distractor-en boring
@distractor-en cinema

@sentence
@lu D'Comedie war net witzeg, mee lächerlech.
@en The comedy was not funny, but ridiculous.
@distractor-lu spannend
@distractor-lu traureg
@distractor-en exciting
@distractor-en sad

@sentence
@lu Science-Fiction weist vill Fantasie, an dat fannen ech erstaunlech.
@en Science fiction shows a lot of imagination, and I find that amazing.
@distractor-lu Comedie
@distractor-lu langweileg
@distractor-en comedy
@distractor-en boring

@sentence
@lu De Film Inception ass fir mech e Klassiker.
@en The movie Inception is a classic for me.
@distractor-lu Thriller
@distractor-lu Musical
@distractor-en thriller
@distractor-en musical

@sentence
@lu Ech kucke gär Comedien, wa se wierklech witzeg sinn.
@en I like watching comedies, when they are really funny.
@distractor-lu Krimi
@distractor-lu fad
@distractor-en thriller
@distractor-en dull

@sentence
@lu Serien erzielen d'Geschicht besser wéi Filmer.
@en Series tell the story better than movies.
@distractor-lu Comedien
@distractor-lu Handlung
@distractor-en comedies
@distractor-en plot

@sentence
@lu Reality-Showe fannen ech lächerlech a fad.
@en I find reality shows ridiculous and dull.
@distractor-lu witzeg
@distractor-lu spannend
@distractor-en funny
@distractor-en exciting
